                                "sense_id": "f1c58c35-8188-333a-9cf6-3e10cdb91fde",
                                "text": "Viewed from the cliff top of ‘today’, the cliff foot becomes ‘yesterday’, the advancing lines of sea horses the centuries of history, and the far shore, barely visible, the Age of the Völkerwanderung."
                            }
